<title>UK: UK meals follow higher Chicago lead, trade quiet.</title>
<headline>UK meals follow higher Chicago lead, trade quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sellers on the UK meals and feeds market pushed prices higher on Thursday following overnight gains in Chicago.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was marked up around 1.50 stg a tonne, pushing buyers on to the sidelines.</p>
<p>Traders said they do not expect any improvement on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;I get the feeling it's going to be a very quiet ending to the week,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
